@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Conditional saga compensation and irreversible limits
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

participant "Owner coordinator" as O
participant "Local reservation" as L
participant "External facility" as E
O -> L : reserve protected reference / resource
L --> O : attributable reservation
O -> E : separately eligible consequential attempt
alt confirmed operation cannot complete
 O -> O : assess known effects + current compensation authority
 opt safe local reservation release is actually permitted
  O -> L : attributable release / compensation
  L --> O : released or cleanup unresolved
 end
else partial / unknown external effect
 O -> O : reconcile same attempt before compensation choice
end
note over O,E
 Compensation is a new operation that can fail.
 Releasing a reservation must not orphan a possible consumer.
 Mail receipt, Git effects and deployment are not universally undoable.
end note

@enduml
